 a slightly elevated angle, looking down on the person and the shirt. The overall mood of the image is somber and contemplative.", "The image is a close-up of a person's hand resting on a black fabric. The hand is on the left side of the image, with the fingers slightly curled and the thumb and index finger pointing towards the right side. The fingers are slightly spread apart, with one hand slightly bent at the elbow. The background is a solid black color, and the fabric appears to be slightly wrinkled and textured. On the top right corner, there is a piece of black fabric with small white dots scattered across it. The fabric has a rough texture, with some areas appearing darker and others lighter. The image is taken from a slightly elevated angle, looking down on the hand and fabric.", "The image is a close-up of a person's hand resting on a dark, textured surface. The hand is positioned on the left side of the image, with the fingers slightly curled. The fingers are slightly spread apart, and the thumb is slightly curled at the bottom. The background is blurred, but it appears to be a darker shade of black. The image is taken from a top-down perspective, looking down on the hand and the hand. The texture of the surface is rough and uneven, with some areas appearing darker and others lighter.", "The image is a close-up of a black fabric with a diagonal line running horizontally across it. The fabric appears to be made of a soft, textured material, possibly cotton or a similar material. On the right side of the image, there is a small white triangle that is slightly tilted to the left. The triangle is positioned in the center of the fabric, with the top half of the triangle facing towards the left side of it. It is slightly angled towards the right. The background is completely black, with no other objects or patterns visible. The image is taken from a top-down perspective, looking down on the fabric."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link